        Install `wf`, then:

        - write a page in **src/pages**
        - run `wf serve` and open it
        - read [the guide](/learn) when you are stuck

        ```wf
        page Home(path: "/", title: "Home") { Heading("Hello").h1 }
        ```
        """)
}

